      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>5CM BGL 26M E OF C/L OF HWY 2A

BRASS CAP 5 CM BGL,OPPOSIE THE PENHOLD INN; 26 M EAST OF THE C/L OF HWY 2A;8.2 M NORTH OF THE C/L OF LUCINA 
